  "body": "Please see http://codepen.io/davidMuir/pen/bwWoWo\n\nThe codepen is a stripped down version of a form we were using. We were taking the result of the submit button when using that button, and only when the 'close' button was clicked did we see the value of the close button.\n\nIn Edge however, the value of the close button is sent when 'submit' is clicked.\n",
